  "scientific_limits": {
    "en": "Whole original elongate quadruped with organized low armour rows. [\"Armour exact count and complete life arrangement not copied as measured; simplify consistent rows based on fossil pattern.\", \"Posterior skull projections seen in specific specimen; sexual interpretation not established and not encoded.\", \"Fleshy contour, skin colour and modest keratin covering inferred.\", \"Photos show cast/restoration; no claim original specimen directly inspected.\"] {\"total_length_m\": 4, \"basis\": \"NHM Dino Directory approximate genus size, not exact length of photographed David Sole specimen.\"}",
    "zh": "原创低多边形研究；形态、尺度及不确定性严格以本次已核参考为界。原始限定：Whole original elongate quadruped with organized low armour rows. [\"Armour exact count and complete life arrangement not copied as measured; simplify consistent rows based on fossil pattern.\", \"Posterior skull projections seen in specific specimen; sexual interpretation not established and not encoded.\", \"Fleshy contour, skin colour and modest keratin covering inferred.\", \"Photos show cast/restoration; no claim original specimen directly inspected.\"] {\"total_length_m\": 4, \"basis\": \"NHM Dino Directory approximate genus size, not exact length of photographed David Sole specimen.\"}"
  },
